    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simulation game. The player is a caretaker, and his daily job is to take care of the objects in the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start the game, the warehouse will randomly generate different items, and the objects in the warehouse can be interacted with, but there may be some dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player completes the test, different plots will appear based on some conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to monitor the objects within the specified time through the monitoring screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=792 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, players are overseeing some mysterious objects, and emergencies may occur at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an emergency occurs, players need to quickly reach the containment room and press the emergency button to eliminate the danger, but they must choose the right button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all of the mysterious objects are dangerous, there are also some interesting objects that can be interacted with or help players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players only need to persist for 5 rounds to pass the game test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Subsequent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure mode will be launched later. There are not many containment objects at present, and some new containment objects will be updated later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take about six months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players have good ideas for containing objects, they can leave messages to communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, subsequent updates are free.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a simulation game. The player is a caretaker, and his daily job is to take care of the objects in the warehouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you start the game, the warehouse will randomly generate different items, and the objects in the warehouse can be interacted with, but there may be some dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the player completes the test, different plots will appear based on some conditions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to monitor the objects within the specified time through the monitoring screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=792 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/efb4f3d8f477fda13950500bfedba9a8.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, players are overseeing some mysterious objects, and emergencies may occur at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=800 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/00addd44a4b67215db9fb95620014ef1.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If an emergency occurs, players need to quickly reach the containment room and press the emergency button to eliminate the danger, but they must choose the right button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/a457b9c7232ee60db88888922712591e.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all of the mysterious objects are dangerous, there are also some interesting objects that can be interacted with or help players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.poster.avif?t=1738547996\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.webm?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343530/extras/19e7cff9a2418df51106e523a6a29e25.mp4?t=1738547996\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players only need to persist for 5 rounds to pass the game test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Subsequent</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure mode will be launched later. There are not many containment objects at present, and some new containment objects will be updated later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will take about six months.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players have good ideas for containing objects, they can leave messages to communicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, subsequent updates are free.</p>",
